{"k":"dif","t":"Differentiation","cls":"12","u":"Calculus","s":[["Standard derivatives",[{"q":"Power, exponential, log","f":"\\frac{d}{dx}x^n=nx^{n-1},\\quad\\frac{d}{dx}e^x=e^x,\\quad\\frac{d}{dx}a^x=a^x\\ln a,\\quad\\frac{d}{dx}\\ln x=\\frac1x","n":"$\\frac{d}{dx}\\log_a x=\\frac1{x\\ln a}$; $\\frac{d}{dx}\\ln|x|=\\frac1x$."},{"q":"Trigonometric derivatives","f":"(\\sin x)'=\\cos x,\\ (\\cos x)'=-\\sin x,\\ (\\tan x)'=\\sec^2x,\\ (\\cot x)'=-\\csc^2x,\\ (\\sec x)'=\\sec x\\tan x,\\ (\\csc x)'=-\\csc x\\cot x","d":"$\\frac{\\sin(x+h)-\\sin x}h=\\frac{2\\cos(x+\\frac h2)\\sin\\frac h2}{h}\\to\\cos x$."},{"q":"Inverse trigonometric derivatives","f":"(\\sin^{-1}x)'=\\frac1{\\sqrt{1-x^2}},\\ (\\cos^{-1}x)'=-\\frac1{\\sqrt{1-x^2}},\\ (\\tan^{-1}x)'=\\frac1{1+x^2}","n":"$(\\cot^{-1}x)'=-\\frac1{1+x^2}$, $(\\sec^{-1}x)'=\\frac1{|x|\\sqrt{x^2-1}}$, $(\\csc^{-1}x)'=-\\frac1{|x|\\sqrt{x^2-1}}$."},{"q":"Derivative of $|x|$","f":"\\frac{d}{dx}|x|=\\frac{|x|}x=\\frac x{|x|},\\quad x\\ne0"},{"q":"Hyperbolic and other derivatives","f":"(\\sinh x)'=\\cosh x,\\quad(\\cosh x)'=\\sinh x,\\quad\\frac d{dx}x^x=x^x(1+\\ln x)"},{"q":"Derivatives of $\\sqrt x$ and $\\frac1x$","f":"\\frac d{dx}\\sqrt x=\\frac1{2\\sqrt x},\\qquad\\frac d{dx}\\frac1x=-\\frac1{x^2},\\qquad\\frac d{dx}\\frac1{x^n}=-\\frac n{x^{n+1}}"},{"q":"Derivative of $\\log_{f(x)}g(x)$","f":"\\frac d{dx}\\frac{\\ln g}{\\ln f}=\\frac{\\frac{g'}g\\ln f-\\frac{f'}f\\ln g}{(\\ln f)^2}"},{"q":"Derivatives of $e^{ax}\\sin bx$","f":"\\frac d{dx}e^{ax}\\sin bx=e^{ax}\\sqrt{a^2+b^2}\\sin\\left(bx+\\tan^{-1}\\tfrac ba\\right)","n":"$n$-th derivative: $(a^2+b^2)^{n/2}e^{ax}\\sin\\left(bx+n\\tan^{-1}\\frac ba\\right)$."}]],["Rules",[{"q":"Product and quotient rules","f":"(uv)'=u'v+uv',\\qquad\\left(\\frac uv\\right)'=\\frac{u'v-uv'}{v^2}","n":"$(uvw)'=u'vw+uv'w+uvw'$."},{"q":"Chain rule","f":"\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{dy}{du}\\cdot\\frac{du}{dx}"},{"q":"Parametric differentiation","f":"\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{dy/dt}{dx/dt},\\qquad\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}=\\frac{d}{dt}\\left(\\frac{dy}{dx}\\right)\\Big/\\frac{dx}{dt}"},{"q":"Implicit differentiation","f":"F(x,y)=0\\Rightarrow\\frac{dy}{dx}=-\\frac{F_x}{F_y}"},{"q":"Logarithmic differentiation","f":"y=u^v\\Rightarrow\\frac{dy}{dx}=u^v\\left(v'\\ln u+\\frac{vu'}u\\right)"},{"q":"Derivative of inverse function","f":"\\frac{dx}{dy}=\\frac1{dy/dx},\\qquad\\frac{d^2x}{dy^2}=-\\frac{d^2y/dx^2}{(dy/dx)^3}"},{"q":"Leibniz rule for the n-th derivative of a product","f":"(uv)^{(n)}=\\sum_{r=0}^n{}^nC_r\\,u^{(n-r)}v^{(r)}"},{"q":"Differentiation under the integral sign (Leibniz)","f":"\\frac{d}{dx}\\int_{g(x)}^{h(x)}f(t)\\,dt=f(h(x))h'(x)-f(g(x))g'(x)"},{"q":"Derivative of a product of $n$ functions","f":"\\frac{(f_1f_2\\cdots f_n)'}{f_1f_2\\cdots f_n}=\\sum\\frac{f_i'}{f_i}"},{"q":"Second derivative of parametric curves (shortcut)","f":"\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}=\\frac{\\dot x\\ddot y-\\dot y\\ddot x}{\\dot x^3}"},{"q":"Second derivative of implicit curves","f":"y''=-\\frac{F_{xx}F_y^2-2F_{xy}F_xF_y+F_{yy}F_x^2}{F_y^3}"},{"q":"Derivative at a point from a functional equation","f":"\\text{put } y=0 \\text{ or } y=x \\text{ in the equation, then differentiate w.r.t. one variable}"},{"q":"Differentiation of functions in parametric trig form","f":"x=a\\cos^3t,\\ y=a\\sin^3t\\Rightarrow\\frac{dy}{dx}=-\\tan t"},{"q":"Derivative of $f(g(x))$ at a point from tables","f":"(f\\circ g)'(a)=f'(g(a))\\,g'(a)"}]],["n-th derivatives",[{"q":"Standard n-th derivatives","f":"\\frac{d^n}{dx^n}e^{ax}=a^ne^{ax},\\quad\\frac{d^n}{dx^n}\\sin(ax+b)=a^n\\sin\\left(ax+b+\\frac{n\\pi}2\\right)","n":"$\\frac{d^n}{dx^n}\\frac1{ax+b}=\\frac{(-1)^nn!\\,a^n}{(ax+b)^{n+1}}$; $\\frac{d^n}{dx^n}\\ln(ax+b)=\\frac{(-1)^{n-1}(n-1)!\\,a^n}{(ax+b)^n}$."},{"q":"n-th derivative of $x^m$","f":"\\frac{d^n}{dx^n}x^m=\\frac{m!}{(m-n)!}x^{m-n}\\ (n\\le m);\\qquad\\frac{d^n}{dx^n}x^n=n!"},{"q":"n-th derivative of $\\cos(ax+b)$ and $a^x$","f":"a^n\\cos\\left(ax+b+\\tfrac{n\\pi}2\\right);\\qquad a^x(\\ln a)^n"},{"q":"n-th derivative using partial fractions","f":"\\frac1{x^2-a^2}=\\frac1{2a}\\left(\\frac1{x-a}-\\frac1{x+a}\\right)\\ \\Rightarrow\\ \\text{differentiate each}"}]],["Common results",[{"q":"Substitution tricks","f":"\\sqrt{1-x^2}\\to x=\\sin\\theta;\\quad1+x^2\\to x=\\tan\\theta;\\quad\\frac{1-x}{1+x}\\to x=\\cos2\\theta","n":"E.g. $\\frac{d}{dx}\\tan^{-1}\\frac{2x}{1-x^2}=\\frac2{1+x^2}$ for $|x|<1$."},{"q":"Infinite radical / power towers","f":"y=\\sqrt{f+\\sqrt{f+\\cdots}}\\Rightarrow y^2=f+y\\Rightarrow\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{f'}{2y-1}","n":"$y=x^{x^{x^{\\cdots}}}\\Rightarrow y=x^y\\Rightarrow\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{y^2}{x(1-y\\ln x)}$."},{"q":"Derivative of one function w.r.t. another","f":"\\frac{du}{dv}=\\frac{du/dx}{dv/dx}"},{"q":"Derivative of the inverse function at a point","f":"g=f^{-1}\\Rightarrow g'(f(a))=\\frac1{f'(a)}"},{"q":"Derivative of inverse trig compositions (results)","f":"\\frac d{dx}\\sin^{-1}\\frac{2x}{1+x^2}=\\frac{2}{1+x^2}\\ (|x|<1),\\qquad\\frac d{dx}\\cos^{-1}\\frac{1-x^2}{1+x^2}=\\frac{2}{1+x^2}\\ (x>0)"},{"q":"Derivative of $\\tan^{-1}\\frac{a+bx}{b-ax}$","f":"=\\tan^{-1}\\frac ab+\\tan^{-1}x\\ \\Rightarrow\\ \\frac{1}{1+x^2}"},{"q":"Derivative of $\\sin^{-1}(2x\\sqrt{1-x^2})$","f":"\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}\\ \\left(|x|<\\tfrac1{\\sqrt2}\\right)"},{"q":"Derivative of $\\tan^{-1}\\sqrt{\\frac{1-\\cos x}{1+\\cos x}}$","f":"\\frac12\\quad(0<x<\\pi)"},{"q":"$\\frac{dy}{dx}$ for $x^y=y^x$, $e^{x+y}=xy$ etc.","f":"x^y=y^x\\Rightarrow\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{y(y-x\\ln y)}{x(x-y\\ln x)}"},{"q":"$y=f(x)$ satisfies a DE — verify by differentiating","f":"\\text{differentiate twice, eliminate the constants}","n":"E.g. $y=e^{m\\sin^{-1}x}\\Rightarrow(1-x^2)y''-xy'-m^2y=0$."}]],["If this type comes, solve like this",[{"q":"If $y$ is an inverse-trig expression of a messy ratio","f":"\\text{simplify first: } \\frac{\\sqrt3\\cos x+\\sin x}{\\cos x-\\sqrt3\\sin x}=\\tan\\left(x+\\tfrac\\pi3\\right)\\ldots","n":"Substitute $x=\\tan\\theta$, $\\sin\\theta$, $\\cos2\\theta$ to collapse the inside to one angle, mind the interval, then differentiate the simple linear expression.","p":"5 PYQs (2019–2026) · asked 10 times"},{"q":"If $y\\sqrt{1-x^2}+x\\sqrt{1-y^2}=k$ (or similar symmetric implicit form)","f":"x=\\sin A,\\ y=\\sin B\\Rightarrow\\sin(A+B)=k\\Rightarrow A+B=\\text{const}\\Rightarrow\\frac{dy}{dx}=-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-y^2}}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}","p":"1 PYQ (2019–2026) · asked 4 times"},{"q":"If it is an implicit curve and asks $y'$, $y''$ at a point","f":"\\text{differentiate both sides w.r.t. } x,\\ \\text{put the point in before solving for } y'","n":"Find $y'$ at the point numerically, then differentiate again and substitute again for $y''$.","p":"3 PYQs (2019–2026) · asked 8 times"},{"q":"If $f(x)=x^3+x^2f'(1)+xf''(2)+f'''(3)$ type","f":"\\text{let } f'(1)=a,\\ f''(2)=b,\\ f'''(3)=c;\\ \\text{differentiate, form three equations}","p":"2 PYQs (2019–2026) · asked 3 times"},{"q":"If $y=u^v$ or a product of many factors","f":"\\ln y=v\\ln u\\Rightarrow\\frac{y'}y=v'\\ln u+\\frac{vu'}u;\\qquad\\frac{y'}y=\\sum\\frac{f_i'}{f_i}","n":"For $(1+x)(1+x^2)\\cdots(1+x^{16})$ multiply by $(1-x)$ first: $y=\\frac{1-x^{32}}{1-x}$.","p":"3 PYQs (2019–2026) · asked 4 times"},{"q":"If it asks $\\frac{d^2x}{dy^2}$ or parametric second derivative","f":"\\frac{d^2x}{dy^2}=-\\frac{y''}{(y')^3};\\qquad\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}=\\frac{d}{dt}\\left(\\frac{dy}{dx}\\right)\\frac{dt}{dx}","p":"2 PYQs (2019–2026) · asked 3 times"},{"q":"If a functional equation gives $f'$ ratios","f":"\\text{put } y=0\\ \\text{or}\\ x=0,\\ \\text{differentiate w.r.t. one variable}","p":"3 PYQs (2019–2026) · asked 4 times"},{"q":"If it asks to verify a DE like $(x^2-1)y''+\\alpha xy'+\\beta y=0$","f":"\\text{find } y \\text{ explicitly (e.g. } y^{1/4}=x+\\sqrt{x^2-1}),\\ \\text{then } y'=\\frac{4y}{\\sqrt{x^2-1}}\\ldots","p":"1 PYQ (2019–2026) · asked 2 times"},{"q":"If the function is a determinant in $x$","f":"\\frac{d}{dx}\\Delta=\\text{differentiate one row at a time}","p":"1 PYQ (2019–2026) · asked 1 time"},{"q":"If chain rule through nested functions at a point","f":"(f\\circ g)'(a)=f'(g(a))g'(a)","p":"5 PYQs (2019–2026) · asked 7 times"}]]]}